{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally Comes Home"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Feeling Sick"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 14}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le14ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Past Tense and Past Continuous tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Simple Past tense to talk about events that are finished. You use the Past Continuous to talk about events or an action that was happening at a time in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Simple Past tense verbs can be regular or irregular.</p> Regular verbs end in <span class=\"strong\">-ed</span> or <span class=\"strong\">-ied</span>.</p> For Past Continuous, we add <span class=\"strong\">was/were</span> + verb\u201c<span class=\"strong\">ing</span>\u201d to verbs.</p> You use Past Continuous verbs to describe a longer action that is interrupted by a shorter action.</p> You use Simple Past verbs to describe the shorter action."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"had\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were having\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"eat\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ate\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were eating\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"visit\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"visited\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were visiting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"feel\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"felt\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were feeling\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"catch\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"caught\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were catching\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hurt\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hurt\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were hurting\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: I had indigestion last night. My stomach hurt really badly! I ate at a weird falafel place when we were visiting the market.</br> <span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: Me too! I think we ate something bad while we were visiting the market."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Common Health Problems"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you are ill, you use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">I feel sick\u2026</span> or <span class=\"italic\">I have a/an\u2026</span> to describe the health problem."}, {"type": "text", "content": "These are some common health problems:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You ask <span class=\"italic\">Are you feeling ok?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">What's wrong?</span> if you want to know about someone's health problems."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":10,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Health Problem\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Stomach ache\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain in your stomach\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Headache\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain in your head\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Earache\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain your ear\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sore throat\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain in your throat\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A cold\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A common sickness caused by a virus\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The flu\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A serious sickness caused by a virus\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Toothache\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain in your tooth\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Backache\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain in your back\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Cramp\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A sharp pain in a muscle\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: What's wrong, Bob?</br> <span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: I feel sick. I have a headache.</br> <span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Does your stomach hurt?</br> <span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: Yes. I also have heartburn."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to catch a bug"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to fall sick with an unspecified illness"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I think I caught a bug on the plane. My stomach hurts."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob09aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you feel sick."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "immune"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "resistant to a particular infection or illness"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Doctors are immune to many illnesses."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob09aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "falafel"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a Middle Eastern dish of fried mashed chickpea balls"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I love eating falafel with pita bread."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob09aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "indigestion"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "pain in the stomach after you eat something bad"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I ate a bad falafel and now I have indigestion."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob09aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "inflamed"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "red and swollen, often because of an infection"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My throat is inflamed."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob09aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "heartburn"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a form of indigestion that feels like a burning sensation in the chest"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I ate a bad falafel and now I have heartburn."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob09aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "flight attendant"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who works on board a plane"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Flight attendants are immune to everything!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob09aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sweetie"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a term of affection; sweetheart"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What's wrong, sweetie?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob09aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue (10-12) about going to the doctor for a health problem you are experiencing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe the health problem. How do you feel? When did it start?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "What could be the cause? What can you do about it?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Listen to the doctor's advice and thank them."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the dialogue aloud."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue (10-12 lines) about a health problem."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about what I was doing when something else happened."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I give advice."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I describe a sickness and a cure for it."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le14ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le14ob09re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le14ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Mum? I don't feel too good.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: What's wrong, sweetie?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm not sure. My throat feels really swollen and inflamed. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Does your head hurt?", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le14ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: My head feels fine now, but my stomach doesn't. I also have heartburn. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Hmm ... What did you eat this morning? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I had my usual breakfast.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Maybe you just have a bit of indigestion.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: No ... I think I ate something bad in Cairo.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Are you sure?", "id": 2, "time": "10600", "image": "engenn5le14ob09re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes. I ate at a weird falafel place while we were visiting the market.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: That was a few days ago! Were you feeling sick when you took the plane?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I guess not ...</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: I bet you caught a bug from one of the passengers!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What about the flight attendants? They should be sick all the time!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Sweetie, I think they are immune to everything, including jetlag!", "id": 3, "time": "28800", "image": "engenn5le14ob09re2img06.jpg"}]}}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about common health problems. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk or report about actions, events or people. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can say what I was doing when something else happened.  "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Are you allergic to a certain kind of food?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What do you do when you feel sick? Call a doctor? Go to bed?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "co